aur sooraj aur chaand"]]}},{"id":"sec_s1l12_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 1 • LESSON 12</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-'Atf 'Waw' (Aur): الْكِتَابُ ، الْقَلَمُ ← الْكِتَابُ وَالْقَلَمُ (Page 36–37)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، الْقَلَمُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-'Atf (وَ = Aur)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ وَالْقَلَمُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، الْقَلَمُ (Kitaab, Qalam) → الْكِتَابُ وَالْقَلَمُ (Kitaab aur Qalam).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 36–37):** Arbi mein **`وَ`** ka aam matlab **'aur' (And)** hota hai. Yeh do, teen ya zyada ismon aur jumlon ko aapas mein jodta hai (`الْكِتَابُ وَالْقَلَمُ`، `السَّمَاوَاتُ وَالْأَرْضُ`)."}},{"id":"sec_s1l12_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail misaalein dekhein (Darj zail misaalon par ghaur karein):"}},{"id":"sec_s1l12_r3","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar ki misaalon se zahir hai ke lafz (وَ) ka matlab 'aur' (and) hai. Yeh do alfaaz ko aapas mein jodta hai. (وَ) ke pehle aur baad ke alfaaz par teeno tarah ki harakaat (zabar َ , zer ِ , pesh ُ ) aa sakti hain. Neeche diye gaye columns mein pichle sabaq ke padhe hue Qur'ani alfaaz ko (وَ) ke saath joda gaya hai."}},{"id":"sec_s1l12_lbl4","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Aap in Qur'ani alfaaz ko khud samajh sakte hain (Page 36):"}},{"id":"sec_s1l12_g5","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l12_g5_w1","arabic":"الْحَقُّ وَالْبَاطِلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقُّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبَاطِلُ</span>","hinglish":"Haq aur Baatil","translations":{"en":"The truth and falsehood","ur":"حق اور باطل","hi":"हक़ और बातिल (सत्य और असत्य)"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w2","arabic":"الْعِلْمُ وَالْجِسْمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعِلْمُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجِسْمُ</span>","hinglish":"Ilm aur Jism","translations":{"en":"Knowledge and physique / body","ur":"علم اور جسم","hi":"इल्म और जिस्म (ज्ञान और शरीर)"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w3","arabic":"الْجَنَّةُ وَالْمَغْفِرَةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَنَّةُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَغْفِرَةُ</span>","hinglish":"Jannat aur Maghfirat","translations":{"en":"Paradise and forgiveness","ur":"جنت اور مغفرت","hi":"जन्नत और मग़फ़िरत"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w4","arabic":"الْكِتَابُ وَالْحِكْمَةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكِتَابُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحِكْمَةُ</span>","hinglish":"Kitaab aur Hikmat","translations":{"en":"The Book and wisdom","ur":"کتاب اور حکمت","hi":"किताब और हिकमत (बुद्धिमत्ता)"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w5","arabic":"الدُّنْيَا وَالْآخِرَةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الدُّنْيَا </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْآخِرَةُ</span>","hinglish":"Dunya aur Aakhirat","translations":{"en":"This world and the Hereafter","ur":"دنیا اور آخرت","hi":"दुनिया और आख़िरत"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w6","arabic":"الْمَشْرِقُ وَالْمَغْرِبُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَشْرِقُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَغْرِبُ</span>","hinglish":"Mashriq aur Maghrib","translations":{"en":"The East and the West","ur":"مشرق اور مغرب","hi":"मशरिक़ और मग़रिब (पूर्व और पश्चिम)"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w7","arabic":"اللَّيْلُ وَالنَّهَارُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّيْلُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّهَارُ</span>","hinglish":"Raat aur Din","translations":{"en":"The night and the day","ur":"رات اور دن","hi":"रात और दिन"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w8","arabic":"السَّمَاءُ وَالْأَرْضُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّمَاءُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأَرْضُ</span>","hinglish":"Aasmaan aur Zameen","translations":{"en":"The heaven and the earth","ur":"آسمان اور زمین","hi":"आसमान और ज़मीन"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w9","arabic":"الشَّمْسُ وَالْقَمَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الشَّمْسُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقَمَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Suraj aur Chaand","translations":{"en":"The sun and the moon","ur":"سورج اور چاند","hi":"सूरज और चाँद"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w10","arabic":"الذَّكَرُ وَالْأُنْثَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الذَّكَرُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْأُنْثَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Mard aur Aurat","translations":{"en":"Male and female","ur":"مرد اور عورت (نر اور مادہ)","hi":"मर्द और औरत (नर और मादा)"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w11","arabic":"التَّوْرَاةُ وَالْإِنْجِيلُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّوْرَاةُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْجِيلُ</span>","hinglish":"Tawraat aur Injeel","translations":{"en":"The Torah and the Gospel","ur":"تورات اور انجیل","hi":"तौरात और इंजील"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w12","arabic":"الْإِنْجِيلُ وَالْقُرْآنُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْإِنْجِيلُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الْقُرْآنُ</span>","hinglish":"Injeel aur Quran","translations":{"en":"The Gospel and the Quran","ur":"انجیل اور قرآن","hi":"इंजील और क़ुरआन"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w13","arabic":"الْبِرُّ وَالتَّقْوَىٰ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْبِرُّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">التَّقْوَىٰ</span>","hinglish":"Neki aur Taqwa","translations":{"en":"Righteousness and piety","ur":"نیکی اور تقویٰ","hi":"नेकी और तक़वा"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w14","arabic":"الصَّلَاةُ وَالزَّكَاةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الصَّلَاةُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">وَ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">الزَّكَاةُ</span>","hinglish":"Namaz aur Zakaat","translations":{"en":"Prayer and zakah","ur":"نماز اور زکوٰۃ","hi":"नमाज़ और ज़कात"}},{"id":"s1l12_g5_w15","arabic":"الْحَجُّ وَالْعُمْرَةُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَجُّ </span><span class=\"no